    58	
    59	`uv run python scripts/kaggriculture_parity/sweep.py --games 40 --traces
    60	engine_rs/target/kaggriculture-parity/sweep-final` ran at `8ca378b` (46 s, single
    61	process). The log is `sweep.log`, and the summary is `sweep-summary.json`.
    62	
    63	- **Games:** 40 games (base seed 20,260,929, step 7,919), with 21,824 transitions
    64	  and 155 Python-rejected steps. Every game agrees.
