+| `cargo test --offline` | Initial exit 101: missing local Python; after setup, stopped by SIGTERM (status −15), no final counts | `7.5/root-tests.log`; `7.5/root-tests-after-setup.log` |
+| `uv run --offline python scripts/check_engine_trim.py` | Exit 0, `engine trim manifest: OK`, after bounded development setup | `7.5/trim-after-setup.log` |
+| `uv run --offline pytest tests/scripts/test_kaggriculture_parity.py tests/tools/test_check_engine_trim.py tests/kaggriculture -q` | Stopped by SIGTERM (shell status 143), no final counts | `7.5/pytest.log` |
+| `uv run --offline python scripts/check_doc_freshness.py` | Exit 0, `No doc updates required` | `7.5/docs-fresh.log` |
