+`bde337465a9fa7c07bedded88d5d696d7cefb7ef` use the owner's offline CPU/thread
+limits. Logs and resource receipts are under `ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/7.5/`.
+The local environment needed offline dependency setup and a development native
+build; subsequent `uv run` checks used `UV_NO_SYNC=true` to keep that build.
+The root suite and pytest selection stopped at the 960 MiB process-tree guard;
+neither produced a final test summary. No historical totals replace them.
